      "items": [
        "The 6 facts: qty, description+UOM, price, delivery term, payment term (+1 carried in costing)",
        "Rev + expiry current: PO must tally the latest Rev; quote is Rev-numbered, validity-dated",
        "Descriptions identical everywhere: quote = PO = costing = invoice draft",
        "UOM critical: DG air freight — UOM mismatch blocks at match and precheck",
        "Match: names+UOM tally with supplier, mismatch to Request, cap 2",
        "Costing = BUM price + 6 facts, copy-forward never retyped",
        "MD gate: reject to Costing",
        "Precheck: quote=PO=costing=invoice draft, last exit",
        "Submit is the point of no return",
        "PO tallies latest Rev; our-side signer Sales (node shows signer: Sales)",
        "D/O + proforma preparer PROVISIONAL (node: preparer OPEN); collection owner PROVISIONAL (node: owner OPEN)",
